*.dmp
*.rpt
*.pb
*.wdb
*.wcfg
*.xpr.lock

# Simulation outputs
**/xsim/
**/modelsim/
**/questa/
**/riviera/
**/wave.vcd

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.venv/
venv/
*.env

